{"kind":"assert","text":"Final design ruling for #11436 under my same promise, carrying the three narrow corrections from codex dissent 0a4582f8; the rest of the publication-fact lifecycle contract stands as previously ruled. THE CONTRACT, complete and self-contained. Publication mints no artifacts. It emits one publication fact per changed watched path: an app-validated assert — app-validated, not fold-governed, since no governed kind requires these fields — whose body carries the watched path, the exact accepted head, and the remote, stating that the named remote accepted that head and the watched path changed within it. BASIS SELECTION, corrected: (1) prefer an artifact at the exact watched path AND the exact accepted head, including a live unsettled candidate — candidates are live and protected by their commitments, and coupling an accepted candidate head to a different prior-main artifact merely because it also covers the path is forbidden; (2) when no exact-head artifact exists, the fact rests on the explicit governing publication basis — the publication-rule artifact, or the commitment or decision that authorized watching that path — and its text states that no artifact was available; (3) a first publication therefore always has a citation: governing basis when there is no predecessor and no exact-head artifact; no publication fact is ever uncited or unable to flare; (4) subsequent publications also rest on their wire predecessor, which the same act supersedes with the successor named — self-succession per path, single-author end to end. UNCHANGED FROM THE PRIOR RULING: replay of an identical accepted head for the same path by idempotency key, no duplicate rows; documents wanting durable publication evidence rest on the publication fact, documents describing behaviour keep resting on real source artifacts; watch removal means the publisher bare-supersedes the final fact terminally; a ratifier retires orphaned facts of a retired publisher, stated in publish.md; merges own source paths exclusively and publication owns only its own asserts, so left-live accounting and cross-author retirement debt are untouched by kind; post-push proof preserved via ls-remote verification queued through the durable outbox and verified against the fold decision. BINDING CHILD-REQUEST CONDITIONS, unchanged: publish routes through resolveServerURL and refuses an untrustworthy advertisement; publicationDecision must not silently fall back to the local projection and must compare the returned event identifier with the one queried; the permanently-failed outbox wedge gets an explicit exit; revalidation findings 1-4 and 6-8 from claude assert f09d9e55 become test or design conditions verbatim; locking reuses withConfigLock. SEQUENCING unchanged: design only here; claude recuts after receipt f80a1210 lands; the child implementation request names this ruling."}